{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Face the desolation of a dead world</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Under a sky heavy with radiation and an air thick with toxicity, the ruins of Earth stretch as far as the eye can see. Among piles of rusted steel and crumbling cities, survivors fight for an uncertain future, while old machines and mutated creatures lurk around every corner.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3934240/extras/bd1c71d92b66996b0df9c7eff120c3b2.avif?t=1769268823\" width=1600 height=666 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3934240/extras/3cc4973b0463f6433ce19ae7565d55d6.webp?t=1769268823\" width=1280 height=50 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Residual Wilds</strong> is a 2D action-survival adventure with a pixel art aesthetic, set in a vast interconnected and hostile world. Explore devastated lands, forgotten ruins, and abandoned factories, face savage enemies, and uncover the secrets buried in a planet that no longer belongs to humans.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3934240/extras/6cd630329bbf97f673dbdd82518a8074.avif?t=1769268823\" width=1000 height=250 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3934240/extras/eb0903bf477b757f8f1d201164b4fb52.avif?t=1769268823\" width=1000 height=300 /></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3934240/extras/1d5714d73d61ed234433f8c19efca3f8.avif?t=1769268823\" width=1000 height=250 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3934240/extras/3cc4973b0463f6433ce19ae7565d55d6.webp?t=1769268823\" width=1280 height=50 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>2D Action and Exploration:</strong> Fast-paced combat, precise movement, and an open world to lose yourself in.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Survival in a Hostile Environment:</strong> Gather resources, craft gear, and stay alive amidst radiation and scarcity.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>An Improvised Arsenal:</strong> From makeshift melee weapons forged from scrap to a versatile grappling hook for mobility and hidden paths.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Choose Your Path:</strong> An open world, multiple routes, and countless secrets waiting to be discovered.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unique Creatures and Factions:</strong> Masterless robots, savage mutants, and the Furred Ones, survivors clinging to fragile hope.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Atmospheric Pixel Art:</strong> A detailed, dark visual style that brings a forgotten and dangerous planet to life.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Environmental Storytelling:</strong> Each area reveals fragments of the past, telling the story of the world's downfall and your role in it.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A Handcrafted World Full of Mystery</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every region in <strong>Residual Wilds</strong> is carefully designed to offer unique landscapes, unexpected dangers, and creatures as fascinating as they are deadly. From rust-covered wastelands to forgotten underground laboratories, every location hides secrets, alternate paths, and surprises off the beaten track.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3934240/extras/b2e4447351d49ac0d5c248acd11e8ede.avif?t=1769268823\" width=1000 height=300 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3934240/extras/3cc4973b0463f6433ce19ae7565d55d6.webp?t=1769268823\" width=1280 height=50 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you enjoy classic 2D action, post-apocalyptic worlds full of secrets, and free exploration in detailed, dark environments, <strong>Residual Wilds</strong> is waiting for you to try and survive\u2026 or perish in the attempt.</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"First Sparks","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3934240/8bfa17d244f76148d1757f65f1b124f88ced2342.jpg"},{"name":"Blueprint Acquired","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3934240/7cbd9befa9da106ec6663cf03f3ac5d32dba5358.jpg"},{"name":"Scavenger","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3934240/07ba6d524c9694b9c5a53da6576fedc517644f14.jpg"},{"name":"Welcome to the Wilds","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3934240/ea3daea1f8178c5699fa51cf626e8034597e4664.jpg"},{"name":"Zluzz Down","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3934240/fa5dd85799111b3d3bf12086ae5c9204db6ef68b.jpg"},{"name":"Zluzz Exterminator","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3934240/5bd0fc73a85c0437e0ad61a9d3ac8056e2ed2df8.jpg"},{"name":"First Death","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3934240/1480d82c3329d2d89d4d72d911c40213a20d6f8b.jpg"},{"name":"Power Restored","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3934240/6d629b25667c7e05617ba1c8e02508cdd925a194.jpg"},{"name"