 secrets waiting to be discovered.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unique Creatures and Factions:</strong> Masterless robots, savage mutants, and the Furred Ones, survivors clinging to fragile hope.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Atmospheric Pixel Art:</strong> A detailed, dark visual style that brings a forgotten and dangerous planet to life.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Environmental Storytelling:</strong> Each area reveals fragments of the past, telling the story of the world's downfall and your role in it.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A Handcrafted World Full of Mystery</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every region in <strong>Residual Wilds</strong> is carefully designed to offer unique landscapes, unexpected dangers, and creatures as fascinating as they are deadly. From rust-covered wastelands to forgotten underground laboratories, every location hides secrets, alternate paths, and surprises off the beaten track.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3934240/extras/b2e4447351d49ac0d5c248acd11e8ede.avif?t=1769268823\" width=1000 height=300 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3934240/extras/3cc4973b0463f6433ce19ae7565d55d6.webp?t=1769268823\" width=1280 height=50 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you enjoy classic 2D action, post-apocalyptic worlds full of secrets, and free exploration in detailed, dark environments, <strong>Residual Wilds</strong> is waiting for you to try and survive\u2026 or perish in the attempt.</p>","developers":["Magic Art Hat"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3